UCF, waste and industrial processes by 2030 compared to BAU in NDC 2022 are higher than NDC 2020, Unconditional contribution increased from 9% to 15.8% and Conditional contribution increased from 27% to 43.5%.\"","document_slug":"revised_first_ndc","group_index":null},{"value":"\u003cp\u003e\"With domestic resources, by 2030 Viet Nam will reduce GHG emissions by 8% compared to BAU, in which:\u003cbr\u003e- Emission intensity per unit of GDP will be reduced by 20% compared to the 2010 levels;\u003cbr\u003e- Forest cover will increase to the level of 45%.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe above-mentioned contribution could be increased up to 25% with international support.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe INDC also includes an adaptation component.\u003c/p\u003e","document_slug":"first_ndc","group_index":null},{"value":"\u003cp\u003e\"With domestic resources, by 2030 Viet Nam will reduce GHG emissions by 8% compared to BAU, in which:\u003cbr\u003e- Emission intensity per unit of GDP will be reduced by 20% compared to the 2010 levels;\u003cbr\u003e- Forest cover will increase to the level of 45%.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe above-mentioned contribution could be increased up to 25% with international support.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe INDC also includes an adaptation component.\u003c/p\u003e","document_slug":"indc","group_index":null}]}},{"id":648353,"source":"Climate Watch","name":"GHG target","slug":"ghg_target","grouping_indicator":false,"category_ids":[64321,64326],"labels":{},"locations":{"VNM":[{"value":"Vietnam commits to reducing its emissions by 15.8% (unconditional) and by 43.5% (conditional) by 2030 compared to BAU.","document_slug":"revised_first_ndc","group_index":null},{"value":"8% (unconditional) up to 25% (conditional) reduction in GHG emissions by 2030 compared to the BAU scenario","document_slug":"first_ndc","group_index":null},{"value":"8% (unconditional) up to 25% (conditional) reduction in GHG emissions by 2030 compared to the BAU scenario","docu